===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:ayenes|tree=1}}
Formed from {{inh|en|enm|ayenes}}, {{m|enm|agenes}}, {{m|enm|againes||in opposition to}}, a southern variant of {{m|enm|agen}}, or directly from {{m|en|again}}, either way with [[adverbial genitive]] singular ending {{m|en|-es}}; the parasitic {{m|en|-t|id=excrescent}} was added circa 1350, probably by confusion with the superlative ending {{m|en|-est}}. {{surf|en|again|-st|pos2=excrescent ending}}.

Cognate with {{cog|stq|juun|t=against}}, {{cog|fy|tsjin|t=against}}, {{cog|nl|tegen|t=against}}, {{cog|nds-de|gegen|t=against}}, {{cog|de|gegen|t=against}}, {{cog|is|gegn|t=against}}.

